{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cmm.zju.edu.cn/2025/0529/c38716a3056627/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:53.348806+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.cmm.zju.edu.cn/2025/0529/c38716a3056627/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span>浙江大学医学院秉承</span><span>“仁心仁术、求是求新”的院训，以“仁爱、求是、创新、卓越”为核心价值观，以培养高层次医学人才为使命，在百年岁月长河中书写了波澜壮阔的育人传奇，为社会培育了大量优秀医学人才，现已发展成为一所</span></span><span>享受较高国际荣誉、</span><span>师资力量雄厚</span><span>、</span><span>优势特色</span><span>明显</span><span>、</span><span>教育模式先进、</span><span>学术成绩卓著的</span><span>研究型、创新型学院</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>浙江大学医学院是国家首批博士、硕士学位授予单位，拥有基础医学、临床医学、</span><span><span>口腔医学、公共卫生与预防医学、护理学</span><span>5个一级学科博士学位授权点，共建药学、生物学、公共管理博士3个一级学科学位授权点。设有临床医学、口腔医学</span></span><span><span>和公共卫生</span><span>3</span></span><span><span>种博士专业学位类别，临床医学、口腔医学、公共卫生、护理</span><span>4种硕士专业学位类别。现有博士研究生导师76</span></span><span>3</span><span>人，硕士研究生导师</span><span>483</span><span><span>人。下设</span><span>13个二级招生单位。</span></span></p><p><span>为进一步促进各高校优秀大学生相互交流，拓展学术视野，提升科研能力，加强广大优秀学子对我院</span><span>及二级招生单位</span><span>的</span><span>了解</span><span><span>，特举办</span><span>“浙江大学</span></span><span>医学院</span><span>202</span><span>5</span><span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营</span><span>”，</span></span><span>旨在为</span><span>优秀学子</span><span>搭建</span><span>深入了解学科特色及学术资源的平台。</span></p><p><strong><span>    一、夏令营概况</span></strong></p><p><span>    本次夏令营</span><span>医学院</span><span>将邀请</span><span>各</span><span>二级招生单位</span><span>优秀教师和同学们进行交流，增</span><span>进</span><span>大家对我院</span><span>各单位</span><span>的</span><span>全面</span><span>了解，同时选拔优秀营员。拟面向全国院校招收营员（包括本校</span><span>生，</span><span>招收</span><span>人数</span><span>由各</span><span>二级招生单位自行确定</span><span>），活动内容包括</span><span>医</span><span>学院</span><span>及二级招生单位</span><span>介绍、学科</span><span>专业</span><span>介绍、名师讲座、师生交流等。</span></p><p><strong><span>    二、申请条件</span></strong></p><p><span>1</span><span>.</span><span> <span>全国高校</span></span><span>基础医学</span><span>、临床医学、</span><span>口腔医学、公共卫生、护理学等</span><span><span>相关专业的</span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>届优秀本科毕业生（</span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年夏季毕业）；</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>.</span><span> <span>学习成绩优秀，英语水平良好，身心健康；</span></span></p><p><span>3</span><span>.</span><span> <span>满足推荐免试研究生标准或有志参加全国研究生招生考试并有意向攻读我院博士、硕士研究生者。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>    三、申请方式</span></strong></p><p><span>    本次夏令营的报名、录取和活动安排由</span><span>各二级招生单位</span><span>具体</span><span>组织</span><span>实施。各单位联系人</span><span>及联系方式</span><span>如下：</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span>二级招生单位</span></p></td><td><p><span>联系人</span></p></td><td><p><span>邮箱</span></p></td><td><p><span>联系电话</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>基础医学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>潘老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:phbzll@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>phbzll@zju.edu.cn</span></a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-88981287</span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>脑科学与脑医学学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>赵老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:yenizhao@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>yenizhao@zju.edu.cn</span></a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-87076127</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>王老师</span></p></td><td><p><span>1476810580@qq.com</span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-85125730</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>公共卫生学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>李老师</span></p></td><td><p><span>lijr707@zju.edu.cn</span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-88981604</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>第一临床医学院</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:%E8%83%A1%E8%80%81%E5%B8%88zju1graduate@163.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>沈</span><span>老师</span></a></span></p></td><td><p><span>fahzjuad@aliyun.com</span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-87231277</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>第二临床医学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>孙</span><span>老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:%E5%BC%A0%E8%80%81%E5%B8%88zjuzeyy2015@163.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>zjuzeyy2015@163.com</span></a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-87784594</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>第三临床医学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>陶</span><span>老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:syf_yjs@163.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>syf_yjs@163.com</span></a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-860065</span><span>68</span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>第四临床医学院</span></p><p><span>“一带一路”国际医学院（含遗传所）</span></p></td><td><p><span>柴老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:0918248@zju.edu.cn%EF%BC%9B0579-89925132\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>0918248@zju.edu.cn</span></a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0579-89925132</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>高老师</span></p></td><td><p><span>yinglonggao@zju.edu.cn</span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-88208328</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>妇产科学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>汪老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:zdfy@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>zdfy@zju.edu.cn</span></a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-89998671</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>儿科学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>俞</span><span>老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:chjyb@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>chjyb@zju.edu.cn</span></a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-866700</span><span>54</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>口腔医学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>董老师</span></p></td><td><p><span>zdkouqiang123@163.com</span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-87219287</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>护理系</span></p></td><td><p><span>黄老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:huanghui1970@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>huanghui1970@zju.edu.cn</span></a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-88208105</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>良渚实验室</span></p></td><td><p><span>王老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:wyying@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>wyying@zju.edu.cn</span></a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-88790286</span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>转化医学研究院</span></p></td><td><p><span>金老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:yiwenjin@zju.edu.cn%EF%BC%9B0571-86971603\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>yiwenjin@zju.edu.cn</span></a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-86971603</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>王老师</span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"mailto:mengyaowang@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>mengyaowang@zju.edu.cn</span></a></span></p></td><td><p><span>0571-88981576</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span> </span></p><p><span>    报名步骤：</span></p><p><span>1.申请者</span><span>请</span><span>登录浙江大学研究生招生</span><span>管理系统，</span><span><span>链接地址：</span>https://yjsy.zju.edu.cn/grsinfo/zs/user/login，</span><span>注册后</span><span>进行网上报名</span><span><span>。具体操作详见学生操</span></span><span><span>作手册（</span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/be1cec7aab4d4a2533a5.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cmm.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/3f/65/aed67435473fbe804418dbd38b2d/58348496-7832-47ec-9a8d-b467f72fbbd7.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">研究生招生管理系统夏令营模块学生操作手册.pdf</a></span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span>；</span></p><p><span>    2.</span><span>请将</span><span>所有证明材料原件按以下顺序扫描并</span><span><span>整合成</span><span>PDF（不超过10M）后，在网申系统“附件”中上传，</span></span><span><span>文件名为</span><span>“</span><span>报名</span></span><span>二级招生</span><span><span>单位</span>-姓名</span><span>-所在本科院校</span><span><span>”</span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span>    （</span><span>1</span><span>）个人身份证（正反面）；</span></p><p><span>    （</span><span>2</span><span><span>）本科成绩单（须加盖学校教务处或院系公章）</span>;</span></p><p><span>    （</span><span>3</span><span>）总评成绩排名证明（应包含所学专业同年级人数，须加盖学校教务处或院系公章）；</span></p><p><span>    （</span><span>4</span><span><span>）外语水平证明材料：</span>CET-6、雅思、托福、专业外语成绩等；</span></p><p><span>    （</span><span>5</span><span>）其他材料：如已发表论文、各类获奖或资格证书等。</span></p><p><span>    以上所有材料均应真实有效，若发现申请人有弄虚作假行为，取消其申请资格并通报申请人所在本科院校。</span></p><p><span>    特别提醒：</span></p><p><span>    请于</span><span>二级招生单位规定时间</span><span>前</span><span>完成报名，逾期报名视为无效。</span><span>递交材料</span><span>内容</span><span>和递交形式以各单位夏令营通知中要求内容为准</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>    四、审核与录取</span></p><p><span>由我院各</span><span>二级</span><span>单位负责，择优录取</span><span>，</span><span>确定录取营员名单</span><span>。结果将通过夏令营报名系统公布，申请者可进入系统查看学院初审意见，</span><span>入选者也将收到各单位通知，未入选者不另行通知。被录取同学需</span><span>在截止时间前登入系统</span><span>，</span><span>确认</span><span>是否参加</span><span>，</span><span>逾期未确认视</span><span>作</span><span>放弃资格。</span></p><p><span>    五、夏令营安排</span></p><p><span>医学院各单位夏令营拟安排在</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span><span>日</span><span>-7月</span></span><span>10</span><span>日，具体时间、</span><span>活动内容及形式</span><span>，</span><span>请关注</span><span>后续各二级</span><span>招生</span><span>单位通知</span><span>。</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><strong><span>二级招生单位夏令营公告链接</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>基础医学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>https://bms.zju.edu.cn/2025/0429/c85156a3044184/page.htm</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>脑科学与脑医学学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>http://www.neuroscience.zju.edu.cn/2025/0424/c75666a3042231/page.htm</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>公共卫生学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>http://www.phs.zju.edu.cn/2025/0606/c47204a3059123/page.htm</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>第一临床医学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>https://www.zy91</span><span>.com/content/default2/153/9400</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>第二临床医学院</span></p></td><td><p>https://www.z2hospital.com/contents/584/23474.html</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>第三临床医学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>https://www.srrsh.com/articleInfo/5890#content</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>第四临床医学院</span></p><p><span>“一带一路”国际医学院（筹）（含遗传所）</span></p></td><td><p><span>https://gjyxy.zju.edu.cn/2025/0609/c77105a3060030/page.htm</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>妇产科学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>https://www.womanschool.cn/index/article/details/id/489/pid/15/zid/0.html</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>儿科学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>https://www.zjuch.cn/news/default/id/12838/cid/363</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>口腔医学院</span></p></td><td><p><span>https://www.zjuss.cn/24-5272</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>护理系</span></p></td><td><p><span> <img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/be1cec7aab4d4a2533a5.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cmm.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/3f/65/aed67435473fbe804418dbd38b2d/2049188a-4d72-43b9-b5e1-3bc06a9fd0d8.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">浙江大学护理系关于举办2025优秀大学生夏令营的通知.pdf</a></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>良渚实验室</span></p></td><td><p><span>http://liangzhulab.zju.edu.cn/index.php?m=content&amp;c=index&amp;a=show&amp;catid=249&amp;id=2001</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>转化医学研究院</span></p></td><td><p><span>http://itm.zju.edu.cn/notice/details-2xlygzjdxzhyxyjyzbxlybmtz-1415.html</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>浙江大学医学院</span></p><p><span>202</span><span>5</span><span>年</span><span>5</span><span>月</span><span>29</span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"7e26a670751a42263fca17db7895730684881788b8a1b706bb9b96816b253d5f","textLength":2896,"sourceSha256":"e1849b055dc0d8521f0ae6c0ede1a2c1b86c5852634ae164befafdfcfb61ae6e","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-97efe744143b271f4253","title":"2025年浙江大学医学院关于举办2025年优秀大学生夏令营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:53.348806+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cmm.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/be1cec7aab4d4a2533a5.gif"},{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cmm.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/be1cec7aab4d4a2533a5.gif"}]}
